<title>USA: Brandywine Realty Trust names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Brandywine Realty Trust names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN SQUARE, Pa. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brandywine Realty Trust said on Monday that Mark Kripke was named chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Kripke has previously been employed as chief financial officer at Stoltz Management in Bala Cynwyd, Pa., and at St. John Group in Radnor, Pa.</p>
</text>
